  "content": "<h1>异界 - 神化</h1><p>对<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化</a>冒险模块的重构/替代，与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auto-leveling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自动升级</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/justleveling-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">升级系统增强版</a>及<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">铁的魔法书</a>深度集成，专为异界模组包设计。<br><br></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-gray?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;labelColor=222222&amp;color=888888\" width=\"159\" height=\"38\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; </strong><a href=\"https://github.com/muon-rw/OtherworldApoth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-gray?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=222222&amp;color=888888\" width=\"146\" height=\"38\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/muonr/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/curseforge-gray?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;labelColor=222222&amp;color=888888\" width=\"194\" height=\"38\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmuon-rw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-gray?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;labelColor=222222&amp;color=888888\" width=\"175\" height=\"38\"></a></h5><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>本模组对神化底层逻辑进行了大规模替换，不建议在自建整合包中使用。</strong>&nbsp;</h2><h3>对神化的修改：</h3><ul>\n<li>完全禁用Boss与MiniBoss</li>\n<li>完全禁用词缀注入与转换的现有逻辑</li>\n<li>完全禁用宝石注入的现有逻辑</li>\n<li>绕过基于维度的稀有度限制规则（详见下文）</li>\n</ul><h3>新增内容与特性：</h3><ul>\n<li>掉落物转换或怪物掉落宝石注入的几率，基于<em>被击杀怪物自动升级等级</em>的稀有度范围</li>\n<li>宝箱战利品转换或宝石注入的几率，基于基于<em>玩家通过升级系统增强版天赋属性获得的\"等级\"</em>的稀有度范围</li>\n<li>为铁的魔法书的<em>施法工具</em>新增法杖战利品类别<strong>——旨在无需神化饰品环即可使用</strong></li>\n<li>为铁的魔法书新增多种词缀与元素宝石</li>\n<li>新增学派专属的铁魔法武器词缀分类系统，确保词缀仅出现在对应装备上</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
